## Issues (`docs/issues/`)

### Filename tags

`[draft]` · `[open]` · `[workaround]` · `[fixed]` (in `fixed/`) · `[canceled]` (in `canceled/`)

| Body status | Filename tag | Location |
|-------------|--------------|----------|
| `draft` | `[draft]` | Filed, not being worked |
| `open` | `[open]` | Actively fixing |
| `workaround` | `[workaround]` | Symptom fix only |
| `fixed` | `[fixed]` | `docs/issues/fixed/` |
| `canceled` | `[canceled]` | `docs/issues/canceled/` — won't fix (document why) |

Workaround requires user permission per [honesty-and-completion.mdc](./honesty-and-completion.mdc).

### Mandatory issue body section order

After metadata block:

1. **`## Status at a glance`**
2. **`**Legend:**`**
3. **`## Acceptance`** / **`## Fix tasks`** — emoji task tables (`I*-A*`, `I*-T*`)
4. **`## Summary`**, root cause, related links

**Reference:** [002](../../docs/issues/002-[draft]-torrent-disk-cache-not-cleaned.md) · [018](../../docs/issues/018-[draft]-migration-playback-parity-unverified.md)

Update [issues README](../../docs/issues/README.md) **Progress** column when rows change.

